      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "title": "Chain Render",
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Chain Render\n\nOne node replaces Ref2VA → masked song audio → guider → sampler → Save Clip. It renders the scenes **in order** and carries the last **22 frames** of each clip into the next one wherever the Cut Plan placed a *soft* cut (onset / downbeat / lyric line). Cuts on a **drop, section start, stop or your tap stay hard cuts** - that is where the sync lives.\n\n- `continuity`: *cut plan decides* (default) / *flow everywhere* / *cut everywhere*.\n- `context_frames`: 5 / 22 / 39 … (22 ≈ 0.9 s of motion; 39 also aligns the audio clock).\n- Wire the performer pictures into `ref_image_1..4` - they are the `<Picture N>` references for every scene.\n- `master_audio` = the song: each scene gets its piece masked into the latent; a continuing scene's pinned head carries the previous piece's tail audio.\n- The writer gets the same `cut_plan`, marks continuing pieces `CONTINUES the previous take` and writes them as one shot opening on the previous last frame.\n\nNeeds ComfyUI-H3-Motion-Context-MultiRef for the masked prefix (installed here); without it the core AddGuide path carries the frames and audio is generated.\n\nClips land in `output/video/` as `MiniMax_H3_sNN_*.mp4`; the node shows a per-scene report."
      ]
    }
